{"surah":84,"ayahs":["إِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span>ءُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نشَ</span>قَّتْ","وَأَذِنَتْ لِرَبِّهَا وَحُقَّتْ","وَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضُ مُدَّتْ","وَأَلْقَتْ مَا فِيهَا وَتَخَلَّتْ","وَأَذِنَتْ لِرَبِّهَا وَحُقَّتْ","<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">يَٰٓ</span>أَيُّهَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>نُ إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>كَ كَادِحٌ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ كَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">حًا فَ</span>مُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">لَٰ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">قِي</span>هِ","فَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا مَنْ أُوتِىَ كِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">تَٰ</span>بَهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> بِيَمِينِهِۦ","فَسَوْفَ يُحَاسَبُ حِسَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">بًا يَ</span>سِيرًا","وَيَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نقَ</span>لِبُ إِلَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> أَهْلِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هِۦ</span> مَسْرُورًا","وَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا مَنْ أُوتِىَ كِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">تَٰ</span>بَهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">رَآ</span>ءَ ظَهْرِهِۦ","فَسَوْفَ يَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>عُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> ثُبُورًا","وَيَصْلَىٰ سَعِيرًا","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_nor